dsh-browser-agent
=================

This package is a fork of:

  terminal-browser — https://github.com/zenbu-labs/terminal-browser
  Copyright (c) 2024 zenbu-labs
  License: ISC

The fork keeps the browser engine (headless Chromium via puppeteer-core: lazy
launch, page navigation, page-to-text extraction, and link extraction) and
replaces the React Ink terminal user interface with DeepSeek Harness tools
(browser_goto / browser_evaluate / browser_screenshot). The stdio JSON-RPC
worker and terminal shell were removed.

See LICENSE for the full license text.
